lients’ needs and translate that knowledge into customer-centric services. Here vice president and chief data privacy officer Ivana Bartoletti talks about how Wipro puts data protection at the heart of all its innovations.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/wipro_logo%401x.9a71c8757fbcd8ce35874a864d5bb4690d8e4fca.png","displayLocation":"India","customerNameLower":"wipro limited","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Professional Services","sortDate":"2024-10-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/generative-ai-wipro/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"WIPRO LIMITED","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"Wipro Works with AWS, Uses Generative AI to Deliver Security, Flexibility","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mgmt-govern","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Management \u0026 Governance","description":"Management \u0026 Governance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#athena","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Athena","description":"Amazon Athena","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-15T04:54:50+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_