ted":"2024-07-26T11:53:54+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Foxintelligence by NielsenIQ delivers market and consumer insight to manufacturers and retailers through its artificial intelligence (AI)–powered data platform. As a data-driven company, it has harnessed machine learning from day one, building cutting-edge solutions for its clients with Amazon Web Services (AWS) technology and support. Using AWS security and generative AI tools, Foxintelligence simplifies compliance with data regulations as the business expands worldwide, and explores new use cases for greater efficiency and innovation.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/foxintelligence-vector-logo.abb9122a5da9d49feff8d7a25b15050d41435144.png","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/foxintelligence-vector-logo.abb9122a5da9d49feff8d7a25b15050d41435144.png","displayLocation":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","customerNameLower":"foxintelligence","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2024-07-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/foxintelligence-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Foxintelligence","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"Foxintelligence Enhances Ecommerce Insight Using AWS and Generative AI","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-seg