:19+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"HeyJobs measures its success by linking the right employers with the right talent. To do this it needs the latest technology that allows its engineers to create new features and functionality. Using Amazon Web Services (AWS) Managed Services, says chief technology officer Boris Diebold, liberates his team from operations, security, and systems updates. With faster development cycles and easier compliance with regulations such as General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), HeyJobs can focus on maintaining a competitive edge.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/heyjobs-logo%401x.2de12445ecad456fcb854c542040f00ce8d30828.png","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/heyjobs-logo%401x.2de12445ecad456fcb854c542040f00ce8d30828.png","displayLocation":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","customerNameLower":"hey jobs","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2024-07-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/heyjobs-data-protection/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Hey Jobs","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"HeyJobs Keeps Focus on Innovation Using AWS Managed Services","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cognito","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Cognito","description":"Amazon Cognito","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:25+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet",