-case-study","dateCreated":"2024-12-16T17:36:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-12-16T17:40:50+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Jimmy Energy (Jimmy) has been turning up the heat, with nuclear power taking center stage in its massive decarbonization campaign. Its small-scale generators can reduce carbon footprints across multiple industries, but to facilitate their safe and efficient operation, the company needed a reliable high performance computing (HPC) solution. Using Amazon Web Services (AWS), Jimmy implemented a natively built solution that optimized time savings while maintaining scalability and security.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Jimmy%20Energy%20logo%401x.327f22d9410ffe7fef6fb9bff4cedd0ce1c9ac8c.png","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Jimmy%20Energy%20logo%401x.327f22d9410ffe7fef6fb9bff4cedd0ce1c9ac8c.png","displayLocation":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","customerNameLower":"jimmy energy","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Energy","sortDate":"2024-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/jimmy-energy-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Jimmy Energy","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"Jimmy Energy Builds Scalable and Secure HPC for Nuclear Heating Simulations on AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudwatch","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GL