40 percent on infrastructure costs, which were previously around $15,000 per month. The company also leverages Amazon Personalize, a ML-based recommendation engine to increase engagement and conversion rates from new and existing customers. Within 3 months of using Personalize, Shgardi was able to increase monthly orders by 20 percent and boost the conversion of new visitors into customers by 30 percent.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/shgardi-logo%401x.445db51d0481c3071ce3b45f998d34bdb2f34761.png","displayLocation":"Saudi Arabia","customerNameLower":"shgardi","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2023-06-29","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/shgardi/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Shgardi","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"Shgardi Boosts Monthly Orders by 20%, Cuts Costs by 40% Using AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-0