the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#broj-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"broj-case-study","dateCreated":"2023-04-12T22:45:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-20T22:26:11+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Broj, a Korea-based startup, offers an integrated fitness management solution that provides fitness center, member, and reservation management services. Using Amazon Rekognition, the company is the first in the fitness industry to introduce access control via facial recognition.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/apac/customer-references-logos-(%401x---%402x)/Broj_logo%401x.361b57db90651c8e7581659818761b316737cead.png","displayLocation":"Korea","customerNameLower":"broj","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2023-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/broj-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Broj","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"BROJ Launches First AI Fitness Center Management System On AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudfront","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon CloudFront","description":"Amazon CloudFront","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"custo