L) -guided best practices and abstractions to improve agility, security, velocity, and code quality.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-14T01:14:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T01:14:12+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#poder-judicial-san-luis-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"poder-judicial-san-luis-case-study","dateCreated":"2024-08-15T21:34:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-08-15T21:43:39+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Maletín Fiscal, un sistema web que además de posibilitar el acceso a los datos, ayudó a erradicar los documentos físicos en el Poder Judicial de la provincia de San Luis (Argentina), surgió on-site en 2021. En 2023, fue llevado a la nube de Amazon, resultando reducción de costos del 60.25% y una excepcional escalabilidad, confiabilidad y seguridad a 14,870 casos.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/poder-judicial-san-luis-logo%401x.568950167baaf5b940ca0fdd90323e56a1e4bdd0.png","displayLocation":"Argentina","customerNameLower":"poder judicial de san luis","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Justice \u0026 Public Safety","sortDate":"2023-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/poder-judicial-san-luis-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Poder Judicial de San Luis","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"Sistema web del Ministerio Público Fiscal de la provincia de San Luis resulta un 60% más económico en la nube AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","