formance, and improve security.  You\u0027ll see how they choose purpose-built AWS database and data caching services for different types of data within their solution. You\u0027ll also see how they leverage AWS CloudFront and AWS Direct Connect in a multi-tenant environment.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/rappi-logo%401x.e3f6d852f68b6a673150b380f45ac07e0a763a10.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"rappi","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Hospitality","sortDate":"2022-07-07","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/i4ueYgjVDCw?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Rappi","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"Rappi: Leveraging EKS, DocumentDB, RDS and ElastiCache to Quickly Scale Kubernetes Clusters","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#documentdb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon DocumentDB","description":"Amazon DocumentDB","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#rds","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon RDS","description":"Amazon RDS","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+