tent in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#predicthq-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"predicthq-case-study","dateCreated":"2021-11-23T01:54:08+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:52+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"PredictHQ has built its microservices-based data pipeline on AWS, executing machine learning (ML) models to process 1.6 million API requests per day. PredictHQ is a demand intelligence company that helps businesses understand the impact of events for more accurate and profitable forecasting. The business is using Amazon EC2 with Reserved Instances and Spot Instances to run its ML models, and Amazon RDS for database management.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/apac/customer-references-logos-(%401x---%402x)/PredictHQ_logo%401x.1cd5ca422357b7bb62d31c2af2f28426e3c5f7ff.png","displayLocation":"Australia","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2021-11-22","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/predicthq-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","customer-name":"PredictHQ","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"PredictHQ Helps Businesses Optimize Revenue from Events with Demand Intelligence"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#australia","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","na