Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#indonesia","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Indonesia","description":"Indonesia","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:36+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#awssolutions5t6k9sle0c","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"awssolutions5t6k9sle0c","dateCreated":"2022-05-23T21:40:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-05-23T21:52:21+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Monitoring IoT devices in real-time can provide valuable insight that can help you maintain the reliability, availability, and performance of your IoT devices. You can track time series data on device connectivity and activity. This insight can help you react quickly to changing conditions and emerging situations.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/partner-network/QuickStart/logos/aws-logo-for-quick-start-150x90.07eba6e92cdd57996dbe3999e3e90a9b83a6841b.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2020-01-29","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/uWUAcc68MWI?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Solutions: Real-Time IoT Device Monitoring with Kinesis Data Analytics","customer-name":"AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kinesis-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Kinesis Data Analytics","description":"Amazon Kinesis Data Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T04:46:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:45+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#iot-core","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS IoT Core","description":"AWS IoT Core","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:42+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","des