t Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#education","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Education","description":"Education","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:01+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#mtc-511-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"mtc-511-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T19:46:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-01-21T02:40:53+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"The San Francisco Bay Area’s Metropolitan Transportation Commission (MTC) delivers up-to-date online traveler information to tens of thousands of commuters daily, scales to support thousands of additional website users each day, and significantly lowers costs using AWS. MTC’s free 511.org website provides travelers with up-to-the-minute and around-the-clock information about transit, bicycle trips, directions, driving times, traffic conditions, carpool information, parking options, and more.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/case-studies/600x400__511_logo.b499e8dddec888ffb748db756c3aee7f1ba2cbdc.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"The San Francisco Bay Area\u0019s Metropolitan Transportation Commission (MTC) delivers up-to-date online traveler information to tens of thousands of commuters daily, scales to support thousands of additional website users each day, and significantly lowers costs using AWS.","industry":"Government","sortDate":"2016-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/mtc511/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"MTC 511","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2016","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"MTC 511 Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#high-performance-computing","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-ref