ary":"Continental’s digital transformation in the fast-moving automotive sector has seen it create new solutions that represent the future of the industry. Like its Continental Automotive Edge (CAEdge) framework, which connects vehicles to the cloud, speeding up the software development process and providing a platform to deliver next-generation automotive services. Key to accelerating innovation in the cloud, says CAEdge program lead Sonja Hummel, was the close support and technical expertise of Amazon Web Services (AWS). Built in 6 months, CAEdge has cut data processing time from months to hours.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/CONTINENTAL-Logo_black_200x70_1X.8a46411b5867d4c9c928c449c5991db64538ffe8.png","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/CONTINENTAL-Logo_black_200x70_1X.8a46411b5867d4c9c928c449c5991db64538ffe8.png","displayLocation":"Europe","customerNameLower":"continental","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Manufacturing","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/continental-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Continental","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","headline":"Continental Builds Automotive Software Platform on AWS, Cuts Processing Time from Months to Hours","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#aurora","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Aurora","description":"Amazon Aurora","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:37