 and resilient infrastructure. However, the increase in the frequency and severity of distributed denial of service (DDoS) events and bots had become a challenge for the company’s existing infrastructure. So, the company turned to Amazon Web Services (AWS) and migrated from its previous web application firewall (WAF).","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/logos/200x100_logos/200x100_Moovit_Logo.f86150a2afa379df560b4cde6825d6e425fe1c22.png","displayLocation":"Israel","customerNameLower":"moovit","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/moovit-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","customer-name":"Moovit","headline":"Strengthening Protection Against Bots and DDoS Events While Reducing Costs Using AWS WAF with Moovit","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudfront","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon CloudFront","description":"Amazon CloudFront","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#shield","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Shield","description":"AWS Shield","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:00+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#waf","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS WAF","description":"AWS WAF","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#israel","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Israel","description":"Israel","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:55+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#middle-east-africa","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Middle East \u0026 Africa","description":"Middle East \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:53+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#middle-east","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Middle East","description":"Middle East","dateCreated":"2020-04-09T03:53:16+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:53+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#data-protection","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Data Protection","description":"\u003cp\u003eData protection is the process of protecting sensitive information from damage, loss, or corruption.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-14T01:07:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T01:07:32+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#european-league-of-football-sustainability","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"european-league-of-football-sustainability","dateCreated":"2024-06-12T18:23:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-09-18T00:53:32+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"The European League of Football wanted to change the way it brought matches to the viewing public. Just 3 months before the start of the new American football season it decided to shift to remote production. It looked to Amazon Web Services (AWS) to help it make this transition. Moving from labor-intensive on-site production that relied on a team of thousands, it was able to centralize production from its Munich office and produce 69 of its 99 league matches remotely. Using AWS, the organization is increasing efficiency without compromising quality, says chief commercial officer Marcel Mohaupt. It’s also driving sustainability—reducing its carbon footprint by 300 tons to date.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/european%20league%20of%20football%20logo%401x.b8e05c60ed24d5654693e8a3bb215c1a624db172.png","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/european%20league%20of%20football%20logo%401x.b8e05c60ed24d5654693e8a3bb215c1a624db172.png","displayLocation":"Europe","customerNameLower":"european league of football","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/european-league-of-football-sustainability/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"European League of Football","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","headline":"European League of Football Transforms Production, Cuts Carbon Footprint Using AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","n